    {"type":"MCQ","outcome_code":"10-CBSE-ENG-TZ-02","difficulty":"EASY","cognitive_level":"UNDERSTAND","marks":1,"question":"In stanza 4 of the poem, where does the wild tiger snarl?","options":["near a temple","near a village","near the school","near the moon"],"answer":"near a village","explanation":"Tiger near village."},
    {"type":"MCQ","outcome_code":"10-CBSE-ENG-TZ-03","difficulty":"EASY","cognitive_level":"REMEMBER","marks":1,"question":"What is the second-and-fourth-line rhyme called in poetry analysis?","options":["AABB rhyme","ABCB rhyme","ABAB rhyme","free verse"],"answer":"ABCB rhyme","explanation":"ABCB pattern."},
